sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant UDB as sc_users DB
    
    Note over U,UDB: Registration Flow
    U->>GW: POST /api/v1/auth/register\n{name, email, password}
    GW->>GW: Rate limit check (10/15min)
    GW->>GW: Validate input (express-validator)
    GW->>UDB: proxy → user-service
    UDB->>UDB: bcrypt.hash(password, 10)
    UDB->>UDB: INSERT user
    UDB-->>GW: { user, token: JWT }
    GW-->>U: 201 { user, token }
    
    Note over U,UDB: Login Flow
    U->>GW: POST /api/v1/auth/login\n{email, password}
    GW->>UDB: proxy → user-service
    UDB->>UDB: SELECT user by email
    UDB->>UDB: bcrypt.compare(password, hash)
    UDB-->>GW: { user, token: JWT(id,email,role) }
    GW-->>U: 200 { user, token }
    
    Note over U,GW: Protected Request
    U->>GW: GET /api/v1/orders\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT
    GW->>GW: jwt.verify(token, JWT_SECRET)
    GW->>GW: Set x-user-id, x-user-role headers
    GW->>GW: proxy to order-service
    Note over GW: order-service trusts\nx-user-* headers
    GW-->>U: 200 [ orders ]
